### TAREFAS ###

### Criar tarefa
POST {{host}}/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "nome": "Oficina Jogos",
  "status": "pendente",
  "data_come": "2026-08-30",
  "data_termi": "2026-09-02"
}

### Listar tarefas
GET {{host}}/tarefas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Editar tarefa (troca o :id pelo id retornado no POST)
PUT {{host}}/tarefas/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "nome": "Oficina Jogos 2D",
  "status": "em_andamento",
  "data_come": "2026-08-31",
  "data_termi": "2026-09-03"
}

### Excluir tarefa (troca o :id pelo id retornado no POST)
DELETE {{host}}/tarefas/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}